# DAMA-CRM — Official Architecture & Engineering Guidelines

## 1. Project Directory Map & Organization

```
DAMA-CRM/
├── client/                     # Frontend Application (React 18 + Vite + TailwindCSS + Framer Motion)
│   ├── src/
│   │   ├── components/         # Reusable UI & Layout Components
│   │   │   ├── common/         # Buttons, Badges, Modals, Loading spinners, Empty states
│   │   │   ├── layout/         # Header, Sidebar, MobileBottomNav, MainLayout
│   │   │   ├── notifications/  # NotificationCenter, NotificationBadge
│   │   │   ├── invoices/       # RecurringInvoicesTab, ContractsTab, InvoicePDF
│   │   │   └── ui/             # Glassmorphism cards, AnimatedIcon
│   │   ├── context/            # Global React Contexts
│   │   │   ├── AuthContext.tsx       # Authentication, Google Sign-In, Session, RBAC
│   │   │   ├── LanguageContext.tsx   # Internationalization (i18n)
│   │   │   ├── ThemeContext.tsx      # Dark / Light theme toggle
│   │   │   ├── BrandingContext.tsx   # Custom logo, colors, and white-label settings
│   │   │   └── ToastContext.tsx      # Mobile-ergonomic toast notifications & sound chimes
│   │   ├── hooks/              # Custom React Hooks (useDebounce, usePermission, etc.)
│   │   ├── i18n/               # Full Translation Dictionaries (11 supported languages)
│   │   │   └── index.ts        # All localized string keys (Zero hardcoded text rule)
│   │   ├── pages/              # Top-level Page Views
│   │   │   ├── Dashboard.tsx   # Executive CRM KPIs, Pipeline, Charts
│   │   │   ├── Contacts.tsx    # Customer and lead management
│   │   │   ├── Deals.tsx       # Kanban Deal Board & Pipeline
