│   │   │   ├── Inventory.tsx   # Products, Stock, UnoPIM connector
│   │   │   ├── Tasks.tsx       # Agile Sprint Board & Task Management
│   │   │   ├── Integrations.tsx# ERP & Third-party connectors (Odoo, Sage, WC, Shopify...)
│   │   │   ├── Omnichannel.tsx # WhatsApp, Email, Live Chat Hub
